  "description": "File upload control for ASP.NET Web Forms: multiple files, drag and drop, chunked and resumable transfers, direct-to-cloud (S3/Azure/GCS), folder uploads that keep their relative paths, opt-in instant upload (SHA-256 dedupe), image pipeline and editor, WCAG 2.2 keyboard support, and 30 locales. The v4 CuteWebUI API is fully intact, so upgrading from 4.x is a DLL swap - keep your CuteWebUI: markup and your FileUploaded / Items / OpenStream() code unchanged. NOTE: this is the continuation of the 'AjaxUploader' package (last published 4.0.2.7); v5 ships under this id. For ASP.NET Core, use the CoreUpload package instead.",
  "iconFile": "ajaxuploader-icon.png",
  "id": "AjaxUploader.WebForms",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-15T18:53:22.327Z",
