  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "5.3.8: folder uploads preserve relative paths (e.RelativePath, traversal-sanitised); opt-in instant upload via SHA-256 content dedupe; WebkitDirectory for the directory picker; S3 ETags normalised before reaching your IS3Signer; legacy CuteWebUI controls post back automatically again so FileUploaded and AttachmentAdded fire as they did in 4.x. AssemblyVersion stays 5.0.0.0; the shipped DLL reports File version 5.3.8.808.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
